HAO_FP4PV_D64_DETACHED_P_OVERRIDE ?=
# Experimental layouts inside D64's detached 128-column P/PV tail:
#   0: two independent 64-column P/V-scale/P-scale slabs (release default)
#   1: two P payloads, one shared V-scale page, two P-scale banks
#   2: mode 1 plus a stage-0 third payload, completion gated, PV before QK
#   3: mode 2 with stage-0 QK before PV and one full-P release token
#   4: mode 3 with independent first/tail scale release tokens
#   5: stage-1 counterpart of mode 3
#   6: stage-1 counterpart of mode 4
#   7: mode 3, but reuse the existing V-slot completion token
#   8: stage-1 counterpart of mode 7
#   9: stage-0 QK-first with no explicit scale-release token
#  10: stage-1 counterpart of mode 9
#  11: mode 3 with stage-1 V scales in retired QK scratch
#  12: mode 9 with stage-1 V scales in retired QK scratch
#  13: mode 11 with one waiter plus a warpgroup handoff
#  14: stage-1 counterpart of mode 13
#  15: stage-1 V overwrites stage-0's retired first P-scale page
#  16: stage-1 V overwrites stage-0's retired tail P-scale page
#  17: mode 15 with completion before and after the overwrite
#  18: mode 16 with completion before and after the overwrite
